      "instance_name": "UglyDolls_characters",
      "label": "animated characters",
      "description": "A group of six stylized, colorful, and intentionally unattractive cartoon characters from the 'UglyDolls' franchise. They are standing in a line on an orange floor in front of a backdrop with the 'UglyDolls' logo. From left to right: a pink character with antennae, a pink character with a yellow bow, an orange character with a blue loincloth, a white character with large eyes, a green character with antennae, and a lime-green character with an 'X' over its eye. They are all depicted with exaggerated, non-traditional features and expressions.",
