      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "self_deprecating_humor",
      "label": "self-deprecating humor expression",
      "description": "The meme uses irony by juxtaposing the intentionally 'ugly' characters from the UglyDolls franchise with the text 'when you are that ugly you don't have a choice,' suggesting a humorous but harmful self-awareness about appearance. The humor derives from the contrast between the franchise's message of celebrating 'ugliness' and the meme's text that frames it as a negative, burdensome condition.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_29d83ed0"
